 out, and there's somewhere to talk about it now! 𖹭Join us on Discord: discord.gg/3nTkKftpkpIt's a new server and it's where we'll be from here: what we're working on, what's coming and the place to tell us when something feels off. There's a button for it on the demo's end screen too, so you don't have to come back here to find it.The demo gives you your first month of running the airline. Open some routes, meet the people flying on them, make the lounge somewhere worth ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:00:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682100","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4872620-1840944183774813","game_id":"steam-4872620","kind":"announcement","title":"Cozy Airways: July Devlog","summary":"July was a big one. We took Cozy Airways apart and put it back together, and almost every screen you have seen before looks different now. A cozier cockpit The old interface felt like a spreadsheet simulator, so we stripped a lot of it out and softened the colors. Sky sits on a little cloud above the dock now and tells you what actually matters, which means no more notification spam. A tutorial that makes sense Completely redone. Eight quick steps, time pauses so nothing runs away from you, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T19:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183774813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:04:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4872620":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:48:44Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4872620":"2026-10-26T04:48:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"487